-# 8. lm-sensors – Linux senzori (sensors komanda)
-
-ALATI ZA STRES TEST:
-# 1. Prime95 – CPU stres test
-# 2. Intel Burn Test – agresivni stres test
-# 3. Linpack – HPC stres test
-# 4. CPU-Z – stres test i informacije
-# 5. Geekbench – benchmark
